OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy morning with showers
OL,6,Fspreading east, some possibly heavy.
OL,7,FBecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,8,Fafternoon, then outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Freaching the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Funsettled period with sunny spells and
OL,13,Ffurther showers, heavy at times. A
OL,14,Fspell of wet and windy weather on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
